Real coefficients for the element routines in this add-on.

-----------------------------------

  1-100: all relevant real parameters for the stokes & viscoelastic add-on
101-150: reserved for diffuse_interface add-on
151-200: reserved for inertia add-on

201:  factor m of the Power-law model (for gnmodel=1)

202:  Exponent n (for gnmodel=1, 2 and 3)

203:  eta_0 (for gnmodel=2, 3)

204:  eta_inf (for gnmodel=2, 3)

205:  lambda (for gnmodel=2, 3)

206:  parameter a for the Yasuda model (gnmodel=3)

207:  eta_const (for gnmodel=0)

208:  k_B * T, the product of the Boltzmann constant, k_B, and the (absolute)
      temperature T.

209:  tau_y (for yieldmodel=1,2)

210:  regularizing parameter r in yieldmodel=2

211:  eta_max1, value of viscosity for gammadot=0 to avoid dividing by zero.
      (for gnmodel=1)

212:  eta_max2, value of yield viscosity for gammadot=0 to avoid dividing
      by zero. (for yieldmodel=1)

213-250 reserved for future use
